{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"743345004243714049","content":"\"We believe that Lolth wants to take power on the island we reside on. Lolth has captured the physical form of Melora holding her ransom, they want to use Web,\" She gestures to them \"as their avatar on the island inexchange for the return of Melora, or so we believe. I understand that Lolth and the Raven Queen are enemies, she would not want Lolths power to grow.\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T05:59:27.834000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743347974398279811","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
