{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"743345004243714049","content":"\"Once upon a midnight dreary, while I pondered, weak and weary,\nOver many a quaint and curious volume of forgotten lore,\nWhile I nodded, nearly napping, suddenly there came a tapping,\nAs of some one gently rapping, rapping at my chamber door.\n''Tis some visitor,' I muttered, 'tapping at my chamber door-\nOnly this, and nothing more.'\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T06:00:18.079000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743348185141084191","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
