{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"743345004243714049","content":"Lilia looks about in awe, when her eyes settle on the white raven she pauses","created_at":"2020-08-13T06:03:55.229000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743349095934197791","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"743345004243714049","content":"It drops the coin and asks \"”When asleep, we are hidden. When awake, we are watching. We help you follow the path, but our pupils do not study. What are we?”","created_at":"2020-08-13T06:04:21.271000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743349205162131506","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"743345004243714049","content":"All in that low raven voice.","created_at":"2020-08-13T06:04:37.800000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743349274489651203","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
