{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"743345004243714049","content":"Web nods","created_at":"2020-08-13T06:05:15.746000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743349433646710794","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"743345004243714049","content":"\"Clever girl. Clever girl. What have you brought me? It motions to Web.\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T06:05:38.421000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743349528752816128","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"743345004243714049","content":"\"They are being targeted by Lolth, to be used as an avatar on our island, in order to gain power.\" She puts a hand on Webs shoulder \"I want to make sure that doesn't happen... Web has gone through much, and has fought hard searching for their happiness I want them to keep that happiness and find their peace, just as much as I want to prevent Lolth from reaching their goal.\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T06:09:09.267000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743350413104775258","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"743345004243714049","content":"\"The Accuser? The Accuser? The Accuser seeks this one?\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T06:09:35.974000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743350525122052148","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"743345004243714049","content":"Lilia nods \"We believe so.\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T06:10:02.466000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743350636237815869","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"743345004243714049","content":"\"Test them? Have you tested them? Do you speak for them? Are they your responsibility? What judge you?\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T06:10:57.440000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743350866815352933","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"743345004243714049","content":"Lilia looks at Web then back to the White Raven. \"Test?... I know Web to be good, but I do not think to speak for them if they don't wish it. However, it was my words and my request that brought us here so I will take responsibility.\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T06:13:32.721000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743351518111072256","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"743345004243714049","content":"“I can be as big as you are, but I am lighter than a feather. I always follow you until it gets dark. What am I?”The Raven Queen turns to Web.","created_at":"2020-08-13T06:14:09.079000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743351670607446096","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
