{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"743345004243714049","content":"\"What do you say, spiderling? Seem like Lolth. Smell like lolth. Is it agent of lolth?\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T06:15:01.949000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743351892360298506","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"743345004243714049","content":"Web shakes their head. \"Not an agent of Lolth, though use many similar tools. Know that she seeks me for these similarities. In different time, perhaps would have willingly joined her.\" They pause, looking somewhat ashamed. \"Know that if becoming her agent was only way to save Melora, would make that trade.\" They look to Lilia after this last statement. \"Sorry.\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T06:18:06.047000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743352664523276378","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"743345004243714049","content":"\"What do you ask for?\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T06:18:41.718000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743352814138294342","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"743345004243714049","content":"\"Safety of my friends. They all I have left to lose. Do not want have to deal with Lolth to ensure their safety.\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T06:20:38.278000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743353303026368606","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"743345004243714049","content":"\"Safety? No safety. I am not safe. You are not safe. You could take a measure of my power...\" It offers you a white feather. Warning: Taking this feather will make you a warlock, pact of the Ravenqueen per this UA: https://media.wizards.com/2017/dnd/downloads/20170213_wizrd_wrlck_uav2_i48nf.pdf","created_at":"2020-08-13T06:21:59.106000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743353642043572234","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"743345004243714049","content":"Web thinks for a few minutes. They hold out their hand for a brief moment, then take it back. \"I appreciate the offer, but no. Too much of who Web is relies on parts of culture. Would lose culture's gifts. Will not betray one family to save another.\" Web looks to Lilia. \"Your offer better made to her.\" Web kneels to the Raven Queen. \"I thank you greatly for your offer. In another time, another place, perhaps. But not here, not now. Sorry, your majesty.\"","created_at":"2020-08-13T06:29:41.809000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-13T06:38:19.622000Z","id":"743355582760615936","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
