{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"743345004243714049","content":"Lilia bows to the Raven Queen. \"I will always serve you, as I have done so before. You have given me great strength and power to fight in your name. I fear that if I accept this offer I may not be able to help defeat The Hunger as well as I can with the current power you have given me...\" She looks hesitant and unsure if she should accept the feather","created_at":"2020-08-13T06:39:53.645000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743358148987060225","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
